# Launchers are generated/installed per machine (AM, waydroid, JetBrains);
# only the hand-made overrides are versioned.
*
!.gitignore
# firefox: menu goes through the bwrap wrapper (~/.local/bin/firefox)
!firefox.desktop
# pcmanfm: env -u GIO_USE_VFS so it gets gvfs (Trash, drives)
!pcmanfm.desktop
# firechores: AppImage launcher; ghidra: MCP + non-reparenting WM env
!Firechores.desktop
!ghidra.desktop
